cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ALFADEL in scholarly work, please cite the software release."
title: "ALFADEL: A lexicon-aware environment for correcting Arabic OCR/HTR and editing historical orthography"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ibrahim"
    given-names: "Habib"
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
abstract: >-
  ALFADEL is a local, lexicon-aware environment for assisted correction of
  Arabic OCR/HTR and the editorial treatment of historical Arabic orthography.
  It distinguishes probable recognition errors from legitimate historical
  spellings and standard forms, and provides separate standardization and
  preserve-historical-forms workflows with explicit human editorial control.
keywords:
  - Arabic
  - Historical Arabic
  - OCR
  - HTR
  - Digital Humanities
  - Historical Orthography
  - Arabic Morphology
  - Text Correction
  - Manuscripts
